<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: IRIHS NTMA TO SELL 100MLN PUNTS OF BOND DUE 2015.</title>
<headline>IRIHS NTMA TO SELL 100MLN PUNTS OF BOND DUE 2015.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) on Thursday announced that it will auction 100 million punts of the 8.25 percent Treasury bond due 2015 on August 19.</p>
</text>
